  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌒\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f312.png\"/>La Escuela Francisco Cortés Ojeda desarrolló el cierre del ABP “Solsticio de Invierno”, instancia en la que se dio realce a los aprendizajes de los estudiantes en torno a la cultura Mapuche-Huilliche de nuestra zona.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌒\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f312.png\"/>Esta actividad fue una oportunidad para valorar y difundir nuestras raíces culturales, a través de las experiencias y trabajos desarrollados por la comunidad educativa.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌒\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f312.png\"/>La jornada contó con la presencia de establecimientos educacionales invitados, además del área de Educación Municipal y representantes del Concejo Municipal, encabezado por las concejalas Carmen Serón y Luz Eliana Antecao.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-38 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10463\" data-id=\"10463\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/jh85z48rns4w5fj/feria_01_1024x683_7g5nrpopys.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10464\" data-id=\"10464\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/4azrawxyy3ycn3s/feria_02_1024x683_t8fqoggsxl.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10461\" data-id=\"10461\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/3hawmppazdfwpk1/feria_03_1024x683_defea7428u.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10459\" data-id=\"10459\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/pjcufgsrj3k1o2r/feria_04_1024x683_qrzzap3ed5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10460\" data-id=\"10460\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/asya44px3gyhgmd/feria_05_1024x683_21mauj3nvd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10466\" data-id=\"10466\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ittecl1kkz308z0/feria_08_1024x683_lt0rvdmws8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class